1
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:05,970
我最怕什么 让我想想
What am I most afraid of? Hmm. Let's see.

2
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:08,800
全球变暖 还有考试拿B
Global warming... and getting a "B."

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,660
午夜凶铃
The phone ringing in the middle of the night.

4
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:14,060
怕自己太过追求完美
That I'm too much of a perfectionist.

5
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,320
亲爱的 这不是应聘面试
Honey, this isn't a job interview.

6
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,960
噢 老天
Oh, man.

7
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:19,860
最怕应聘面试
Job interviews.

8
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,600
-我无所畏惧 -对哦 那鸽子呢
- Nothing. - Yeah, right. What about the pigeons?

9
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,480
我不喜欢鸽子 太奸诈
Oh, I don't like them. They're shifty.

10
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,780
-失去米奇尔 -噢
- Losing Mitchell. - Oh!

11
00:00:30,448 --> 00:00:33,560
-酒店床单 -呃
- Hotel bedspreads. - Ooh.

12
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,120
拿不到驾照
Never getting my driver's license.

13
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,760
或者是驾照上的照片很丑
Or getting one and the picture sucks.

14
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,240
孤独终老
Dying alone.

15
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,480
海莉 亲爱的 找到你的鞋了吗
Oh, Haley, sweetie, did you find your shoes?

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,580
妈 拜托今天别烦我
Mom, please, not today.

17
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,400
我只想知道你找到鞋没
I just wanted to know if you found your shoes.

18
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,060
别缠着我了 我现在紧张死了
Why are you hounding me? I'm freaking out right now.

19
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,600
放松 不过是路考而已
You need to relax. It's just a driver's test.

20
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,580
是我的第三次路考 如果再考不过
It's my third driver's test, and if I fail again,

21
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,840
要等六个月才能再考
I have to wait six months to retake it.

22
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,140
意味着还要坐半年你开的车
That's six more months of you driving me everywhere.

23
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:01,720
然后我就说"我绝对不会穿的"
Then I'm, like, "There's no way I'm wearing that."

24
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:03,340
-她就说"如果你不穿 -别老说"就"
- And she was, like. "Well, if you don't wear it, -Like

25
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,138
那就没得玩"
then you can't play."

26
00:01:04,138 --> 00:01:06,827
-然后我就说"我无所谓" -亲爱的 就
- And then I was, like, "That's fine by me." - Honey, like.

27
00:01:06,827 --> 00:01:08,223
-然后她就说"如果你不玩" -就就
- And then she was, like, "Well, if you don't play" - Like! Like!

28
00:01:08,223 --> 00:01:11,558
-妈 -别老说"就"了
- Mom! -Stop! Stop saying "Like" All the time.

29
00:01:11,663 --> 00:01:14,289
-别给我丢脸 -别说了 就就就
- You're embarrassing me! - Stop it! Like, like, like, like, aah!

30
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,200
海莉 我找到你的外套了
Haley. Found your jacket.

31
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:20,560
怎么都跟我过不去 我的神啊
Why is everyone on me? God!

32
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:23,820
-别管她 -她一心不能二用
- Ignore her. - She can't focus on two things at once.

33
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:25,760
这对司机来说倒是好品质
Always a good quality in a driver.

34
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:29,020
宝贝 我们得去给你买今晚穿的舞鞋
Sweetie, we need to get you some shoes for the dance tonight.

35
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:30,640
不需要 我不去
No, we don't. I'm not going.

36
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:31,880
你说什么
What are you talking about?

37
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:33,480
你为什么不去跳舞
Why would you not be going to the dance?

38
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,600
因为学校的舞会很没劲
Because school dances are lame.

39
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,280
一群稚嫩男生
A bunch of immature boys

40
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,400
表面上假装成熟
trying to impress you with how cool they are...

41
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,274
实则是乳臭未干的呆瓜
when they're really just a bunch of dorks.

42
00:01:41,274 --> 00:01:43,941
准备好去下面探险了吗 伙伴
Ready to go down under, mate?

43
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:44,420
是的
Yes.

44
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:47,016
你们要干什么
What are you doing?

45
00:01:47,016 --> 00:01:49,230
寻宝
Treasure hunting.

46
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,700
几天前 有线电视修理工去了屋子下面
A few days ago, the cable guy was under the house.

47
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:54,420
他走的时候 跟海莉说
When he was leaving, he said to Haley,

48
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:57,620
"哇 下面的藏品真丰富"
"Wow. That's quite a collection you've got down there."

49
00:01:58,540 --> 00:02:02,500
问题是 我们不知道下面有什么
Here's the thing. We have no idea what he's talking about.

50
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:04,500
整个星期以来 卢克和我越来越好奇
All week, Luke and I have been getting more and more

51
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,660
那些东西是什么
excited about what it could be.

52
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:09,120
我猜是很酷的旧杂志
I bet it's really cool old magazines.

53
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,580
有可能 或者是动物牙齿做的项链
Yeah. Or a bunch of necklaces made out of animal teeth.

54
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,000
或者是虫子琥珀
Or bugs frozen in amber.

55
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:17,720
如果是几瓶好酒呢
What if it's really expensive bottles of wine?

56
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:19,500
或者是一套盔甲
Or a suit of armor.

57
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,940
如果是古老的印第安箭头呢
What if there's ancient Indian arrowheads under there?

58
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:26,760
-说不定是金条呢 -你觉得是吗
- What if it's gold bars? - Oh, you think?

59
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:29,940
神啊 你们为什么不直接去下面看看
For God sakes, why don't you go under the house and look?

60
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:50,020
小卡 这个娃娃从哪来的
Hey, Cam. Cam, where did we get this dolly from?

61
00:02:50,580 --> 00:02:51,440
珍妮丝和奥利维亚给的
From Janice and Olivia.

62
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,200
她们昨天拿过来的 莉莉很喜欢
They brought it over yesterday. Lily loves it.

63
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:55,900
有太多"蕾丝边"了 就跟她们一样
Seems a little frilly, you know, coming from them.

64
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:57,199
就因为她们是拉拉吗
What, because they're lesbians?

65
00:02:57,199 --> 00:02:59,400
你不觉得这是偏见吗
That's sort of an offense stereotype, don't you think?

66
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,900
是啊 抱歉
Yeah, I suppose. I'm sorry.

67
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,500
她们把咖啡机还回来了吗
Oh, hey, did they bring back our coffee maker?

68
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,400
没 太大了 她们是骑摩托车过来的
No. It was too big. They were on their motorcycle.

69
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,900
我们跟莉莉的儿科医生初次见面时很尴尬
We got off to an awkward start with our pediatrician,

70
00:03:08,900 --> 00:03:10,157
她是个热心的亚裔女性
a very nice Asian lady-

71
00:03:10,157 --> 00:03:12,000
-别走题 -叫作缪拉医生
- Irrelevant. - Named Dr. Miura.

72
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,940
于是我冒昧请她过来吃早午餐
So I took the bold step of inviting her over for brunch.

73
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:16,880
抱歉 你说冒昧
I'm sorry. Uh, bold?

74
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,800
她说之前没有病人请过她
She said no patient had ever done it before.

75
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:21,180
是啊 潜台词就是"这很奇怪"
Yeah. Subtext, "This is weird."

76
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:22,740
我不觉得有潜台词
I didn't hear any subtext.

77
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,000
现在也觉得没有吗
Do you hear any now?

78
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:29,940
真不知道为什么要这样
I don't even know why we're doing this.

79
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,500
因为万一哪天莉莉病了
Because what if Lily gets sick

80
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,800
抗病毒药又短缺了
and there's a Tamiflu shortage?

81
00:03:32,875 --> 00:03:35,071
你觉得谁会拿到药
Who do you think's gonna get that medicine?

82
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,560
当然是她喜欢的病人了
The patient she likes, that's who.

83
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:37,960
那你给她烤个蛋糕
Well, maybe if you bake her a cake,

84
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,040
也许就能免费照X光了
she'll give us free X-rays.

85
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,960
要套近乎 搞好交情
It's all about making connections.

86
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:43,120
你以为牙医为什么老免费送我东西
Why do you think the dentist gives me all that free stuff?

87
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:45,880
因为他是个女王受 对你情深难自拔
Um, because he's a huge queen and he has a big crush on you.

88
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:49,100
真的吗 你这么觉得吗
Really? Do you think so?

89
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:51,920
-妈妈 -怎么了
- Mom? - Hmm?

90
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,318
我发烧了
I have a fever.

91
00:03:53,318 --> 00:03:55,332
宝贝 过来让我摸摸看
Ay, mi amor. Come here and I feel you.

92
00:03:55,332 --> 00:03:57,541
我不想传染给你 可能会致命的
Ooh. I don't wanna get you sick. It could be fatal.

93
00:03:57,541 --> 00:03:59,791
那站在我身边就可以吗
Then by all means, stand next to me.

94
00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:01,000
让我量一下你的体温
Let me feel you.

95
00:04:02,732 --> 00:04:05,718
宝贝 你没有发烧
Ay, papi, but you're not warm.

96
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:08,860
可能是因为你在做饭 手温高
Uh, probably because you were cooking and your hands are warm.

97
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:11,900
我明天还是不去参加派对了 安全起见
I better skip the party tomorrow just to be safe.

98
00:04:11,981 --> 00:04:15,334
是啊 明天的派对
Oh. Yeah, the party.

99
00:04:16,482 --> 00:04:19,499
-怎么了 -派对啊
- What? - The party.

100
00:04:19,580 --> 00:04:21,900
我只明白了五分之一
I understand about 20% of what goes on around here.

101
00:04:22,460 --> 00:04:24,300
明天的派对在游乐场举办
The party is at an amusement park,

102
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:27,300
-曼尼怕坐过山车 -可怜的孩子
- and Manny's afraid of roller coasters. - Poor kid.

103
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,158
不知道他的胆小是遗传谁的
I don't know where he gets his fear from...

104
00:04:29,158 --> 00:04:31,264
他的爸爸什么都不怕
because his father's not afraid of anything.

105
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:32,680
不怕公牛 不恐高
No bulls, no heights,

106
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:34,780
不怕电梯和高速行驶的车
no helicopters, no fast cars-

107
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:37,020
但是跟他一起去吃饭 等结账的时候
But go to dinner with him and wait for the check to come.

108
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:39,240
你可以从他眼里看到恐惧
Then you'll see fear in his eyes.

109
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,200
好像服务生是鬼似的
Like the waiter's a ghost.

110
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:43,800
-兴奋吗 -是啊
- Excited? - Yeah.

111
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:47,980
我们就像庞塞·德莱昂和他儿子小庞塞
We're like Ponce de Leon and his son, Little Ponce.

112
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:51,240
-他们是谁 -著名的寻宝家
-Who's that? - Famous treasure hunters.

113
00:04:51,860 --> 00:04:54,960
他叫庞塞 他在我们学校会被嘲笑的
His name was Ponce? He'd get made fun of at my school.

114
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,840
他们可能会叫他"瓶塞"
They'd probably call him "Pants."

115
00:04:58,460 --> 00:04:59,100
瓶塞
Pants.

116
00:04:59,233 --> 00:05:03,386
或者"高级皮条客"
Or maybe, um, "Fancy Ponce."

117
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:04,080
这个说得好
That's a good one.

118
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:06,540
好了
All right.

119
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,900
我们开始吧
Let's do this.

120
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:12,460
-你还好吧 爸爸 -恩 我还好
- You okay, Dad? - Yeah. Yeah, I am.

121
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:14,580
没事 这个算什么
Yep. Gonna take a little more

122
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:17,220
困在黑漆漆的小洞里 与野兽共舞
than getting trapped in a small, dark space with a wild animal

123
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:18,840
-可吓不到你老爸 -好吧
- to rattle your old man. - All right.

124
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,499
当父亲的永远都不想在孩子面前露怯
You never want your kids to see you scared.

125
00:05:20,499 --> 00:05:21,840
你想成为他们心中的坚石
You wanna be that rock

126
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:24,040
在暴风来临时让他们依靠
that they can grab ahold of in a stormy sea.

127
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,960
实际上 石头会沉底 那就当漂浮的石头
Actually, a rock would sink. So a floating rock.

128
00:05:27,900 --> 00:05:31,920
重新说一遍 风很大 你有很多张纸在手
Let's start over. It's windy, and you've got a lot of papers.

129
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:35,380
好了 我们开始吧
Okay. Let's do this, buddy.

130
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,940
好了 侦查成功
Okay! Good recon.

131
00:05:41,003 --> 00:05:43,044
知道地形了 所以
Got the lay of the land, so-

132
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,020
我们不进去吗
Aren't we going in?

133
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:45,400
不 我们进去
Yep, we are.

134
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:49,940
但是用上滑雪护目镜和烧烤工具会更有趣吧
But won't it be fun if we did it with ski goggles and barbecue tools?

135
00:05:50,074 --> 00:05:52,626
-应该是的 -对
- I guess. - Yeah.

136
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,600
-就这么干 -好的
- Yeah. Let's do that. - All right.

137
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:00,140
我想说你这身衣服真好看
Can I just say that is a lovely outfit.

138
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,600
谢谢
Oh. Thank you.

139
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:03,340
你不穿白大褂挺好看的
Well, it's just nice to see you out of your lab coat.

140
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:05,000
你身材很好
You actually have quite a nice figure.

141
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,280
差不多行了
Take it down a notch.

142
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,000
我们是在结交朋友 不是找3P伙伴
We're trying to make a friend, not initiate a three-way.

143
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,800
莉莉看起来很健康
Lily looks great.

144
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,800
真的吗
Do you think so?

145
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,060
她的牙齿不够多吧
Shouldn't she have more teeth?

146
00:06:16,140 --> 00:06:17,660
我看公园里跑来跑去的孩子们
I see these kids running around at the park,

147
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:18,720
牙齿锋利得像鲨鱼
and they look like sharks.

148
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:22,560
不用担心 她很好 是不是呀莉莉
Don't worry. She's perfect. Aren't you, Lily?

149
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,640
她跟你一起好乖
Oh, look how calm she is with you.

150
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,600
一般见到生人她都没这么安静的
She's usually very fidgety around new people.

151
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:27,997
她大概是觉得
Well, I just think she senses

152
00:06:27,997 --> 00:06:28,963
你会是她在平日里
you're gonna be a good friend for her...

153
00:06:29,037 --> 00:06:32,317
和流感季节的好朋友
during good times and- and flu season.

154
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,000
妈咪
Mommy.

155
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,280
她刚刚...
Did she just-

156
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,070
她刚刚说...
Did she just say-

157
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,660
她开口说的第一个字
Well, her first word...

158
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:44,150
是每一个男同父亲最糟的噩梦
was every gay father's worst nightmare.

159
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:46,459
-"妈咪" -心绞痛
- "Mommy." - Oh.

160
00:06:50,077 --> 00:06:53,040
杰 他不承认
Jay, he won't admit it,

161
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,680
但是我知道曼尼因为错过派对而伤心
but I know that Manny's sad because he's missing the party.

162
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:58,240
我们带他出去散散心吧
Why don't we take him somewhere to take his mind off it, hmm?

163
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,187
我就知道他怕过山车
I could have guessed he'd have trouble with roller coasters.

164
00:07:00,187 --> 00:07:01,760
每次他坐在理发店的转椅上
That kid gets woozy at barbershops

165
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,240
店员把他转向镜子 他都会头晕
when they spin his chair towards the mirror.

166
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:06,760
带他去码头钓鱼怎么样 曼尼
How about we take him to the pier and go fishing, huh? Manny!

167
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:09,020
-他喜欢钓鱼 -是啊
- He likes to fish? - Yeah.

168
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:11,840
他的祖上都是渔夫和走私贩
He comes from a long line of fishermen and smugglers.

169
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:13,940
但我支持钓鱼
But I encourage the fishing.

170
