Somebody will ask you.

339
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,600
要是没有人邀请我呢
But what if they don't?

340
00:14:59,300 --> 00:15:01,220
亲爱的 如果他们不邀请你
Honey, if they don't,

341
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:04,660
那就照我跟你姐姐说的做
then you do the exact same thing I told your sister, okay?

342
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:07,000
深呼吸三下 放轻松
Take three deep breaths and relax.

343
00:15:07,620 --> 00:15:09,280
我连收到的建议都是二手货
Even the advice I get is a hand-me-down.

344
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,300
妈 我成功了 我考过了
Mom, I did it! I passed!

345
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,760
天啊
Oh, my God!

346
00:15:13,900 --> 00:15:14,980
-我拿到驾照了 -恭喜
- I got my license! - Congratulations!

347
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,580
我拿到驾照了 拿到驾照了
I have my license! I got my license!

348
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:19,380
-车还没停好 -糟糕
- Car's not in "Park." - Oh. Oops.

349
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:22,200
赶紧去拿驾照
You better run to that counter.

350
00:15:22,295 --> 00:15:24,034
-现在就去 -快跑
- Go. Right now. - Run! Run!

351
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:29,580
还是不敢相信你把我的卡车弄丢了
Still can't believe you lost my truck.

352
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,140
没了就是没了 伙计 忘了它吧
It's gone, buddy. Let it go.

353
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,820
也许不去揭秘更好
You know, maybe it's better we don't solve this little mystery.

354
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:38,580
有时想象中的宝藏更诱人
Sometimes treasure's more sparkly in your imagination.

355
00:15:38,580 --> 00:15:42,600
可能是金子 棒球卡或者海盗藏宝图
Or it could be gold or baseball cards or pirate maps.

356
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,700
你真的觉得下面可能有海盗藏宝图吗
Do you really think there could be pirate maps under there?

357
00:15:45,774 --> 00:15:48,344
我敢肯定是有可能的
I'm a hundred percent sure it's possible.

358
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:51,720
-好吧 我进去 -什么
- All right. I'm going in. - What?

359
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,880
不是吧 伙计
Really? Buddy.

360
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:03,520
看到什么了
What do you see?

361
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:05,880
什么都看不见 下面真黑
Nothing. It's really dark in here.

362
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:08,240
等等 我看到我的车了
Wait a minute. I think I see my truck.

363
00:16:08,660 --> 00:16:10,860
它的旁边是...
It's right over there by the- Uh-oh.

364
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:13,120
-怎么了 -我卡住了
- What? - I think I'm stuck.

365
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:16,840
-卡在哪了 -我的皮带挂在管子上了
- How are you stuck? -My belt loop got caught on a pipe.

366
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:19,000
-管子好烫 -试着摆动一下
- And it's hot. - Have you tried wiggling?

367
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:21,440
爸爸 好烫 快来
Dad, it's hot! Hurry!

368
00:16:21,549 --> 00:16:24,394
-我来了伙计 -快来 下面有蜘蛛
- I'm coming, buddy! - And hurry. There's spiders in here.

369
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:28,180
就来了
Coming!

370
00:16:29,140 --> 00:16:31,220
抱歉给你带来不快
I'm sorry if we got all weird in there.

371
00:16:31,293 --> 00:16:33,160
不 没事
No. It was fine.

372
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,600
我们想说平时不是这样的
Well, we'd like to say it's different than how it usually is,

373
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:38,320
不过你也知道那是假话了
but you've seen us enough to know that that's not true.

374
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:39,420
听我说 同志们
Guys, listen.

375
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:41,920
我和我母亲的关系不太好
I had a very complicated relationship with my mother.

376
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:45,100
她生于日本 非常传统
She was born in Japan- crazy traditional.

377
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:47,020
她不希望我成为医生
She didn't want me to become a doctor.

378
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:48,440
她希望我结婚生子
She wanted me to get married and have kids.

379
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:51,680
但是我父亲 可以和我沟通
But my father, we would talk...

380
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:53,840
他会听取我的想法
and he would actually listen to what I wanted.

381
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,040
不管怎么样 我想说
Anyway, what I'm trying to say...

382
00:16:56,040 --> 00:17:00,000
母亲的角色并不一定那么重要
is having a mother isn't always what it's cracked up to be.

383
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,444
-谢谢 -谢谢
- Oh! Thank you. - Well, thank you.

384
00:17:02,500 --> 00:17:03,940
如果要我说
And if you ask me,

385
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:07,460
能有你们两位如此慈爱的父亲
having two fathers who care as much as you do...

386
00:17:07,460 --> 00:17:09,779
莉莉真是世界上最幸运的小女孩了
makes Lily the luckiest little girl in the world.

387
00:17:09,779 --> 00:17:11,563
-谢谢 -谢谢你这么说
- Oh! Thank you so much. - Thank you. Thank you for that.

388
00:17:11,679 --> 00:17:13,757
-你人真好 -谢谢
- That's very sweet. Thanks. - Thank you.

389
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:16,160
你和你妈妈现在关系怎么样
And how are things with you and your mom now?

390
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:21,100
如果我是个典型的传统亚洲女人她就高兴了
The only way she'll be happy is if I'm some Asian stereotype.

391
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:23,250
但那不是我
But that just isn't me.

392
00:17:28,220 --> 00:17:30,240
我不知道后面有垃圾桶
I didn't see those!

393
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:37,677
-我来了 伙计 -我在这
- I'm coming, buddy. - Over here.

394
00:17:37,677 --> 00:17:41,339
蜘...蛛网 要命
That's... a spider web. Oh, God.

395
00:17:41,420 --> 00:17:42,520
我儿子有困难了
My boy was in trouble,

396
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:46,200
于是我忘却恐惧 跑去救他
so I put my fears aside, and I came to his rescue.

397
00:17:46,260 --> 00:17:47,460
这样我算是英雄了吗
Now, does that make me a hero?

398
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:49,620
当然是了
Yes, it does.

399
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:51,440
不会有事的
Everything's gonna be okay.

400
00:17:51,940 --> 00:17:54,200
不会有事的
Hey. Everything's gonna be okay.

401
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:58,480
-好了 -谢谢爸爸
- There. - Thanks, Dad.

402
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:01,180
父亲就该救孩子于危难之中 我们出去吧
Hey, that's what dads do. Let's get out of here.

403
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:02,820
-我想拿回我的车 -真的吗
- I want my truck. - Really?

404
00:18:02,907 --> 00:18:05,893
它是我的圣诞礼物
It was a Christmas gift.

405
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:07,240
你能去把它捡回来吗
Could you go get it?

406
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:11,080
可以 可以
Yeah. Yeah.

407
00:18:11,144 --> 00:18:14,564
没问题 我们钻过去
Sure. Let's go- Let's go through it.

408
00:18:17,508 --> 00:18:20,092
好了 就在这
Yeah. There it is.

409
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:24,920
拿到了
Got it.

410
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:27,720
-你还好吗 -嗯 你好吗
- You okay? -Yeah. Are you okay?

411
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:31,080
你知道吗 我没事
You know what? I am okay.

412
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:34,000
我们成功了
We did it.

413
00:18:35,502 --> 00:18:38,475
我们到房子下面来了
We're under the house.

414
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:41,520
怎么样 我们进来了
What the heck. We're down here.

415
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,760
-不如看看下面有什么吧 -好啊
- Why don't we see what we got, huh? - Yeah.

416
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:47,660
两个无畏的冒险者
Two intrepid explorers...

417
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:50,400
踏上了冒险的旅程
make their way on a journey-

418
00:18:50,551 --> 00:18:53,318
死尸
Dead bodies!

419
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:56,720
我们报了警 叫来了一群警探
We called the police and got a bunch of detectives over.

420
00:18:57,240 --> 00:19:00,320
结果那些是屋子前主人的万圣节装饰品
Turns out it was the last owner's Halloween decorations,

421
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,340
真是搞笑
which is pretty funny.

422
00:19:02,540 --> 00:19:03,340
至少我是这么觉得
Least I thought it was.

423
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:07,320
每个人都有怕的东西 不是吗
Everybody's afraid of something, right?

424
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:11,420
怕高 怕小丑 怕窄小的空间
Heights, clowns, tight spaces.

425
00:19:11,495 --> 00:19:12,819
喜欢吗 杰
You like it, Jay?

426
00:19:15,293 --> 00:19:16,680
我做到了
I did it!

427
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,280
这些都可以克服
Those are things you get over.

428
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:20,440
然后我们还有孩子
But then there's our children.

429
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,720
他们是否合群
Will they fit in?

430
00:19:27,820 --> 00:19:29,200
是否安全
Will they be safe?

431
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:32,540
我们注定要担心一辈子
Those are fears you never get past.

432
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:36,300
所以有时 我们只能
So sometimes all you can do...

433
00:19:36,363 --> 00:19:39,806
深呼吸 拥抱他们
is take a deep breath, pull 'em close...

434
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:42,300
希望一切安好
and hope for the best.

435
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:44,360
-再见 -注意路面
- Bye! - Eyes on the road.

436
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:46,000
-爱你们 -注意路面
- Love you! - Eyes on the road.

437
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:47,460
天啊
Oh, God.

438
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:50,740
我是说 人不可能事事顺心
I mean, things don't always work out.

439
00:19:50,810 --> 00:19:53,518
小卡 她应该是想要娃娃了
Oh. Cam, I think she wants her doll.

440
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:55,800
-我不知道在哪里 -妈咪
- I don't know where it is. - Mommy.

441
00:19:59,420 --> 00:19:59,900
妈咪
Mommy.

442
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:05,160
一捏这娃娃 它就会说"妈咪"
When you squeeze the doll, it says "Mommy."

443
00:20:05,402 --> 00:20:10,128
-你之前知道吗 -毫不知情
- Did-Did you know that - Not a clue.

444
00:20:10,260 --> 00:20:11,000
娃娃说的"妈咪"
The doll says "Mommy."

445
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:14,320
-是娃娃说的"妈咪" -娃娃说的
- The doll says "Mommy." - The doll says "Mommy."

446
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:16,360
若事事顺心 则要珍惜当下
But you gotta love it when they do.

447
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:22,760
-爸爸 -什么事
- Hey, Dad. - Hmm?

448
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:24,700
妈妈说阁楼里有个旧行李箱
Mom says there's an old trunk in the attic.

449
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:26,900
是的 我爷爷的旧扁平行李箱
Oh, yeah. My grandpa's old steamer trunk.

450
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:29,880
我看的一个电影 里面有一个行李箱
In this movie I saw, there was this old trunk...

451
00:20:29,952 --> 00:20:32,000
和一间秘室
and there's a secret compartment.

452
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,780
打开以后 里面有很多幅画
And when you opened it, there was a whole bunch of paintings,

453
00:20:34,780 --> 00:20:37,620
都是战争时期藏起来的大画家的作品
by the world's greatest painters, hidden in the war.

454
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:39,680
我爷爷参与过战争
My grandpa was in the war.

455
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:41,600
我们要上去看一看吗
Should we go up there?

456
00:20:41,980 --> 00:20:43,400
绝对的 说不定里面是钻石呢
Totally. It could also be diamonds.

457
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:44,520
或者是日本武士军刀
Or a samurai sword.

458
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:46,020
或者是《独立宣言》
Or the Declaration of Independence.

459
00:20:47,500 --> 00:20:50,540
阁楼里有什么并不重要
You know, it almost doesn't even matter what's up there.

460
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:54,600
重要的是怎么花用它换来的钱
What matters is what you do with the money from what's up there.

461
00:20:55,140 --> 00:20:56,500
我们可以买艘汽艇
We could get a motorboat.

462
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:57,980
或者下水道清理机器人
Or a robotic gutter cleaner.

463
00:20:58,240 --> 00:21:01,140
-或者室内泳池 -或者双人潜水艇
- Or an indoor pool. - Or a two-man submarine.
